.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-hook-gsettings 1 "" "Sway Things 0.4.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-hook\-gsettings \- Copy the stored settings that GTK apps read from GSettings (cursor theme and size) to GSettings; run at login and at each reload of sway
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things hook gsettings\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copy the stored settings that GTK apps read from GSettings (cursor theme and size) to GSettings; run at login and at each reload of sway
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
